WEBVTT

00:33:28.562 --> 00:33:31.770
Original music by Hahnsdale Hsu
and Allison Layton-Brown.

00:33:31.794 --> 00:33:34.283
Ad stories produced
by Pineapple Street Studios.

00:33:34.596 --> 00:33:36.507
Special thanks to our sponsors,

00:33:36.531 --> 00:33:40.296
Accenture, BetterUp, Hilton and SAP.

00:33:40.771 --> 00:33:43.991
For their research thanks to Dean Simonton
on creative productivity,

00:33:44.015 --> 00:33:46.379
Lu Liu and colleagues
on career hot streaks,

00:33:46.403 --> 00:33:49.373
Ben Jones and colleagues on the success
of older entrepreneurs,

00:33:49.397 --> 00:33:52.302
David Galenson on conceptual
and experimental innovators,

00:33:52.326 --> 00:33:54.087
Erik Dane on cognitive entrenchment

00:33:54.111 --> 00:33:57.204
and Will Maddux, Adam Galinsky
and colleagues on working abroad.

00:33:57.228 --> 00:34:01.449
(Music)